  m_text: "Alright class, here's your final assignment. \n\nObjective: Design and
    implement a multi-process application in C that simulates a distributed file
    processing pipeline. This pipeline will consist of a series of interconnected
    processes, each performing a specific task on a large input file.\n\n*If you
    manage to do this task, you will have passed the exam without the need to attend
    the written part."
